+
+/**
+ * @brief Creates an <b>OH_Drawing_Path</b> object.
+ *
+ * @syscap SystemCapability.Graphic.Graphic2D.NativeDrawing
+ * @return Returns the pointer to the <b>OH_Drawing_Path</b> object created.
